sequenceDiagram
    participant Client
    participant EventAssignment as EventAssignment
    participant EventBus
    Client->>+EventAssignment: markNoShow()
    Note over EventAssignment: Policies: eventAssignmentRead, eventAssignmentWrite, eventAssignmentExecute
    Note over EventAssignment: Guards (4)
    EventAssignment->>EventAssignment: guard[0]: self.status == #quot;assigned#quot; or self.status == #quot;confirmed#quot;
    EventAssignment->>EventAssignment: guard[1]: self.assignedAt != null
    EventAssignment->>EventAssignment: guard[2]: self.deletedAt == null
    EventAssignment->>EventAssignment: guard[3]: roleAllows(user.role, #quot;workforceManageAccess#quot;)
    EventAssignment->>EventAssignment: compute.previousStatus
    EventAssignment->>EventAssignment: mutate.status
    EventAssignment->>EventAssignment: mutate.noShowAt
    EventAssignment->>EventBus: emit EventAssignmentNoShowMarked on event_assignment.no_show_marked
    EventAssignment-->>-Client: void